  "Question": "Counting from the left, what is the position of the one at the very front?",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "The 1st one",
    "B": "The 5th one",
    "C": "There are 5 in total"
  },
  "Correct Answer": "A",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "Assume “very front” means the leftmost item, where counting begins. The one at the very front is the 1st one; “how many there are in total” refers to the total number, not an ordinal position.\n\nIf “front” instead means the head of a queue, its position depends on the direction. For example, a queue of five facing left has its front 1st from the left; facing right, its front is 5th. The wording alone is therefore ambiguous. Under the recorded leftmost interpretation, the answer is the 1st one, choice A.",
